dsurf\",\n    \"title\": \"Claude Opus 4.7 Fast Mode\",\n    \"description\": \"Claude Opus 4.7 (fast mode) is now available in Windsurf with full intelligence of Opus 4.7 but with ~2.5x higher output speeds.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-12\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.130.0 - Plugin Management Improvements\",\n    \"description\": \"Codex CLI 0.130.0 (May 8, 2026) includes plugin details showing bundled hooks, plugin sharing with link metadata and discoverability controls, `codex remote-control` entry point, and app-server thread pagination APIs.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-08\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Codex for Chrome Extension\",\n    \"description\": \"New Chrome extension for Codex with improved ability to work with apps and websites in the browser. Works in parallel across tabs without taking over the browser.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-07\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.129.0 - TUI Workflow Improvements\",\n    \"description\": \"Codex CLI 0.129.0 (May 7, 2026) adds modal Vim editing in TUI composer, redesigned resume/fork picker, raw scrollback mode, `/ide` context injection, and workspace-aware `/diff`. Plugin management now supports workspace sharing, share access controls, and marketplace removal/upgrades.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-07\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Windsurf\",\n    \"title\": \"Devin Review and Agent Command Center\",\n    \"description\": \"All Windsurf IDE users now have access to Devin Review and Quick Review with existing subscription. Agent Command Center improvements include list display option for agent inbox, improved sessions sidebar sorting and filtering, and performance improvements.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]\n",
